		"Saque largo a ninguna parte: cabeza rival y a defender.": "A long kick to nowhere: rival header, and back to defending.",
		"El saque no encuentra a nadie. Balón muerto y a empezar otra vez.": "The kick finds no one. Dead ball, and start again.",
		"Se fue sin dueño. Un saque de meta que no llegó a nadie.": "Gone without an owner. A goal kick that reached nobody.",
		"Se la quitan al primer pase, a un paso de tu portería. Regalo.": "They take it off the first pass, a step from your goal. A gift.",
		"Del saque de meta al fondo de la red. Toda la cancha en una jugada.": "From the goal kick to the back of the net. The whole pitch in one move.",
		"Empezó en el guante de tu portero y acabó en gol. Así se sale.": "It started in your keeper's glove and ended as a goal. That's how you play out.",
		"De tu portero a la red sin pasar por ti. Lo viste de cerca.": "From your keeper to the net without passing through you. You had a close view.",
		"Gol de la salida de meta. Tú no la tocaste, pero la viste nacer.": "A goal from the goal kick. You never touched it, but you saw it born.",
		"Salió de tu portero y la acabaste tú. Cien metros de jugada.": "It left your keeper and you finished it. A hundred metres of football.",
		"Saque de meta, campo cruzado y gol tuyo. De área a área.": "Goal kick, pitch crossed, and your goal. Box to box.",
		"Saque de banda en corto, a tus pies. Ahora decides tú.": "Short throw-in, to your feet. Your call now.",
		"Te la saca el lateral y la jugada sigue. Balón cuidado.": "The full-back throws it in and play goes on. Ball kept.",
		"Te la saca al pecho. Bájala y a jugar.": "Thrown in to your chest. Bring it down and play.",
		"Saque de banda, control de pecho y la jugada viva.": "Throw-in, chest control, and the move is alive.",
		"La colgaron con las manos y la metiste con la cabeza.": "They threw it in by hand and you put it away with your head.",
		"Saque de banda al área y cabezazo a la red. De pizarra.": "Long throw into the box and a header into the net. Straight off the whiteboard.",
		"La cuelgan desde la banda y la despejan ellos. A por la siguiente.": "Thrown in from the touchline and they clear it. On to the next one.",
		"Saque largo al área y cabeza rival. Esta vez no.": "Long throw into the box and a defender's head. Not this time.",
		"Cabezazo tras el saque de banda y el portero lo saca.": "Header from the throw-in and the keeper keeps it out.",
		"Saque largo, remate de cabeza y una parada de las buenas.": "Long throw, header, and a top-drawer save.",
		"Saque de banda al área, cabezazo y fuera. Faltó dirección.": "Long throw into the box, header, and wide. Needed more direction.",
		"La peinas tras el saque largo y se marcha. Cerca.": "You flick it on from the long throw and it drifts off. Close.",





