		"¡SAQUE DE BANDA!": "THROW-IN!",
		"¡{0} SACA DE BANDA!": "{0} TAKES THE THROW!",
		"Naces en tu campo con el balón y el arco lejos. Conduce, pásala a un compañero y sigue: el pase se golpea como un tiro y juegas con quien la recibe. Si te quedas atrás sin avanzar, el rival aprieta. Después, el mano a mano: tira ya, o condúcela y vuelve al círculo para parar en seco y apuntar con calma.": "You start in your own half with the ball and the goal far away. Dribble, pass to a teammate and keep going: a pass is struck like a shot and you play as whoever receives it. Hang back without moving forward and the opponents press harder. Then, the one-on-one: shoot right away, or carry it and come back to the circle to stop dead and aim calmly.",
