		"TODOS LOS TÉCNICOS": "EVERY MANAGER",
		"Los has tenido a todos. Ahora se reúnen los martes para superarlo.": "You've had them all. Now they meet on Tuesdays to get over it.",
		"¡ES ÉL! ¡EL QUE PEDÍA SER TITULAR!": "IT'S HIM! THE ONE WHO WANTED TO START!",
