		"TU PRIMERA PLACA": "YOUR FIRST PLAQUE",
		"Ya estás en el Salón de la Fama. El conserje tiene la foto que lo demuestra.": "You're in the Hall of Fame. The caretaker has the photo to prove it.",
		"PARA MI CUÑADO, QUE NO SE LO CREE": "FOR MY BROTHER-IN-LAW, HE DOESN'T BELIEVE ME",
