		"TODA LA COLECCIÓN": "THE WHOLE COLLECTION",
		"Lo has completado todo. Te han hecho una estatua. El pelo es del utillero.": "You've completed everything. They made you a statue. The hair is the kit man's.",
		"LEYENDA ETERNA": "ETERNAL LEGEND",
		"¿ESE PELO ES DEL UTILLERO?": "IS THAT THE KIT MAN'S HAIR?",
		"TODOS LOS FESTEJOS": "EVERY CELEBRATION",
