		"TOCA VENDER": "MUST SELL",
		"Te sientan en el vestuario con el director deportivo. {0} está en crisis: si la caja sigue bajo la raya roja al cierre, la liga le quita {1} puntos. Eres lo que más vale del vestuario, y tu traspaso es el dinero que falta.": "They sit you down in the dressing room with the sporting director. {0} are in crisis: if the cash is still below the red line at the close, the league takes {1} points off them. You are the most valuable man in the dressing room, and your transfer is the money they are missing.",
		"EL CLUB NO PAGA": "CLUB WON'T PAY",
		"Te sientan en el vestuario con el director deportivo. {0} no tiene con qué pagarte: llevas {1} partidos sin cobrar y te deben ${2}. Si aguantas, cobras cuando llegue el dinero. Si pides la carta, en verano eres libre.": "You're sat down in the dressing room with the sporting director. {0} can't afford to pay you: you've gone {1} matches unpaid and you're owed ${2}. If you stick it out, you get paid when the money arrives. If you ask for your release, you're a free agent in the summer.",
