		"Hay elecciones en {0}. El candidato promete dinero para fichar y quiere tu foto en su campaña. Tu foto mueve votos; la grada se acuerda de quien elige al que pierde.": "There are elections at {0}. The candidate promises transfer money and wants your photo in his campaign. Your photo swings votes; the fans remember who backs the loser.",
