		"EL JEQUE SE VA": "SHEIKH LEAVES",
		"El jeque deja el {0} y su nómina se queda: crisis": "Sheikh leaves {0} but his payroll stays: crisis",
		"El jeque se ha ido y su dinero con él, pero la nómina que firmó se queda. Este verano el club tiene que vender, y si la caja sigue bajo la raya roja al cierre, la liga le quita {0} puntos.": "The sheikh is gone and his money with him, but the payroll he signed stays. This summer the club has to sell, and if the cash is still below the red line at the close, the league takes {0} points off.",
		"LA SALA DE JUNTAS": "THE BOARDROOM",
		"Sin rodeos: no hay dinero. Este verano el club tiene que vender, y si la caja sigue bajo la raya roja al cierre, la liga le quita {0} puntos.": "Plain and simple: there is no money. This summer the club has to sell, and if the cash is still below the red line at the close, the league takes {0} points off them.",
