		"{0} tiene dueño nuevo y lo quiere entero: te ofrece ${1} por la parte que compraste en la asamblea, que te costó ${2}.": "{0} has a new owner and he wants all of it: he offers you ${1} for the stake you bought at the members' meeting, which cost you ${2}.",
		"HUELGA EN EL VESTUARIO": "DRESSING ROOM STRIKE",
		"{0} lleva {1} partidos sin pagar a nadie y a ti te debe ${2}. El capitán os reúne antes de entrenar: nadie sale al campo hasta que el club pague. Si os plantáis todos, la directiva rasca la caja y paga ${3}. Si tú entrenas, la huelga se rompe.": "{0} has gone {1} matches without paying anyone, and owes you ${2}. The captain gathers the squad before training: nobody takes the pitch until the club pays. If you all hold out, the board scrapes the coffers together and pays ${3}. If you train, the strike is broken.",
