		"SUS PADRES, EL DOMINGO": "HER PARENTS, SUNDAY",
		"Los padres de {0} vienen a comer el domingo, como cada mes. Tu agente te ha cerrado una sesión de fotos a la misma hora.": "{0}'s parents are coming for lunch on Sunday, like every month. Your agent has booked you a photo shoot at the same time.",
